   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# H3 Open Regen 2K, IC recipe on the H3 Open Regen nodes\n\nOne pipeline: rdh9616's Open-H3 Regenerate nodes, running slmonker's Open-H3-Regenerate-2K-IC recipe.\n\n1. **Load Video** -> **Prepare Draft**: 768p, max_frames 124, fps_map **floor (IC official)**, min_real_frames **113**.\n2. Draft -> **VAE Encode** -> **Latent Upscale** 2k (2560 x 1440).\n3. **IC Official Prompt** (TASK text + your caption) -> **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video** with the draft on `ref_video_0`,\n   width / height / length = 2560 x 1440 x 124 (must equal the upscale target).\n4. **Refine Latent** with `reference_latent` = the Reference to Video LATENT: audio pinned to encoded silence.\n5. Ref2VA model -> **LoRA** in IC recipe (speed_lora HyperFlow 8-step -> sharp_lora LMS Sharp r64 -> lora_name = the IC\n   LoRA, Diffusers or ComfyUI keys; curve_name none) -> **H3 Sigma Shift** 12 / 3.\n6. **Sigmas** grid **IC up3** (0.834942, 0.696852, 0.468753, 0) -> Euler, Basic Guider (CFG 1).\n7. **VAE Decode** -> **Finish Frames** (drops padding, cuts the draft audio) -> **Create Video** -> **Save Video**.\n\nModel files (place them yourself): Ref2VA `minimax_h3_ref2va_bf16`, the IC LoRA (official `open_h3_regenerate_2k_ic_lora`\nor the ComfyUI conversion `minimax_h3_open_regenerate_2k_ic_comfy_bf16`), HyperFlow 8-step, LMS Sharp r64, the latent\nupscaler, the H3 video and audio VAEs."
   ],
   "title": "README · IC in the H3 Open Regen nodes"
  },
